## ⚡ Circuit Design & Multisim Analysis

The pedal circuit consists of an input buffer, NPN transistor amplifier stage, and diode clipping network[cite: 1]:

1. **Multisim Modeling:** Performed AC sweep and transient analysis in NI Multisim to evaluate frequency response and identify clipping thresholds[cite: 1].
2. **Signal Saturation:** Selected specific diode configurations to achieve controlled soft-clipping and desired harmonic saturation[cite: 1].

